        "message": "Implement the Phase 6 semantic-on guarded profile and stationary smoke\n\nThe on-arm candidate differs from the Phase 5 guarded candidate only by\nthe additive cost-200 semantic layer in both costmaps (arm identity\nproven by test_phase6_params.py). The plugin builds as an overlay on the\nfrozen console image (semantic-safety-console-phase6), sourced only for\nPhase 6 arms. The fixture gains PHASE6_SEMANTIC_ARM wiring checks, a\nservice-pulled semantic-grid verification (no steady-state subscription\nload on the safety pump), and the disarmed stationary smoke: fresh soft\ncosts at the mat, target removal through the pre-warmed mover, and\nclearing within the Phase 4 expiry bound. A domain-85 semantic bridge\nsidecar (own CPU quota) runs in both arms for identical load; the\nrunner validates the frozen guarded GPU profile for every Phase 6 arm.\nphase6_topology.py factors the private SAM3 topology lifecycle for\npilots. 209 safety + 119 script tests pass."
      },
